  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Qin Ding Ling was originally the leader of Heavenly Court. Here she sits fourth and has to obey the three fairies at the top. The first and second fairies are not around. Fairy Ming Hao’s large eyes shine with sparkling starlight specks. She replies in a childish voice that she has heard of Fang Yuan, asks whether Qin Ding Ling needs to deal with him personally, and sends an information path Gu worm so Mu Cha Lang and Qing Hao Zi lead troops out instead.",
      "chapters": [
        2155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_qin_ding_ling",
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "char_mu_cha_lang",
        "char_qing_hao_zi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has the appearance of a three to four year old girl. She is cute and delicate, and her large eyes shine with sparkling starlight specks.",
      "chapters": [
        2155
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ice Crystal Immortal Monarch and Xiao He Jian treat her as having rank eight cultivation level. She names herself to Ke Xin Hong, copies his poison path method, then resonates with the Sacred Mountain of black lines and white paper behind her. She says she casually created humble reciprocation using humility Gu as the core, and that the move uses information recorded on Book Mountain to deduce and unleash killer moves opponents have just used. Fang Yuan’s subordinates are stopped by that one person until Lu Wei Yin arrives with muddy yellowish light.",
      "chapters": [
        2159
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "single-handed-blockade",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
